OL,3,GNEWSADriver sentenced over teacher's
OL,4,Acycle crash death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver has been given a community
OL,7,Fsentence over the death of a
OL,8,F"fantastic" teacher who was knocked
OL,9,Fdown while riding his bike.
OL,11,FJustin Loveland, who was head of sixth
OL,12,Fform at The Woodroffe School in Lyme
OL,13,FRegis, Dorset, crashed at about 07:30
OL,14,FBST on 16 May 2025 in Bridport Road,
OL,15,FDorchester.
OL,17,FThe 50-year-old died at Southampton
OL,18,FGeneral Hospital the following day from
OL,19,F"unsurvivable" brain injuries, Weymouth
OL,20,Fmagistrates were told.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
