OL,3,GNEWSADriver sentenced over teacher's
OL,4,Acycle crash death
OL,5,
OL,6,FBecky Blake, 55, of Stoke Road,
OL,7,FWeymouth, pleaded guilty to causing
OL,8,Fdeath by careless driving and was
OL,9,Fordered to carry out 150 hours of
OL,10,Funpaid work. She was also banned from
OL,11,Fdriving for two years.
